{"id":1111101,"name":"시글린데·심문 I","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"시글린데·심문 I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1111101]}],"trial":{"trial_id":111101,"stage":"1단계","unlock_time":"2025-11-07 05:00:00","diary1":"관리국은 디스 변방의 마을에서 보낸 구조 신호를 접수했다. 잿더미의 파도는 빠르게 접근하고 있었고, 구조는 지체할 수 없는 상황이었다.","diary2":"화이트 샌드의 환경은 혹독했다. 하지만 더 골치 아픈 것은 구조대 내부의 갈등이었다. FAC 소대와 구 디스군 출신의 연락관 시글린데 간의 마찰은 잦았고, 그들은 서로를 신뢰하지 않았다. 당신은 임무가 순조롭게 진행될 있수도록 여러 차례 나서서 중재할 수밖에 없었다.","evidence":[{"ID":260803,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260804,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":3,"dialogue_id":211101017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":211101023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"di